      "description": "A flagship 12-story stationery department store in Ginza offering premium pens, paper, design goods, and creative workshops.",
      "highlights": [
        "12 Floors of Fine Stationery",
        "Custom Notebook & Pen Bar",
        "Design & Lifestyle Goods"
      ],
      "notes": "Head to the 11th-floor indoor vegetable farm and 12th-floor cafe after browsing custom stationery levels.",
      "reservation": "No reservation required for store browsing.",
      "parking": "No private store parking; use paid parking garages along Ginza Chuo-dori.",
      "openingHours": "10:00 - 19:00 (Sundays/Holidays 10:00 - 19:00)"
